howing changes consistent with treatment effect   Invasive carcinoma consists of infiltrating tumor cell clusters that extend up  to and abut  but do not infiltrate  the fibrotic nodule  The tumor bed  dimensions measure REMOVED_DATE x 1 7cm after incorporating histologic findings   Invasive carcinoma shows an average cellularity of approximately 5  with a  minimal in situ component  The pre treatment right breast core biopsy has been  returned to the originating institution and is not available for morphologic  comparison  MGH  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID       One of sixteen axillary lymph nodes contains a 0 1cm micrometastasis  seen on  multiple level sections  and biopsy site changes  The resulting architectural  disruption from the biopsy hinders definitive evaluation for extranodal  extension  Treatment effect is not seen in the other 15 negative nodes     Based on the above findings  the tumor response in the breast is estimated to be  Miller Payne grade 3 of 5  and Residual Cancer Burden calculated to be REMOVED_DATE   RCB II         Electronically Signed Out By Amy Ly MD           By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis  certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or  corrected the diagnosis       PROCEDURES ADDENDA    Hormone Receptor Quantitation  Ordered Date  REMOVED_DATE    B  BREAST MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY  RIGHT  S P NEOADJUVANT CHEMOTHERAPY   Block tested   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   The invasive tumor cells stain for estrogen receptor protein   The invasive tumor cells stain for progesterone receptor protein   The invasive tumor cells do not show overexpression of HER 2 protein     Note   Estrogen and progesterone receptor quantitation  The percent of immunoreactive  nuclei in the tumor cells is assessed visually and reported as follows     The tumor cells stain    10  of nuclei stained     Some tumor cells stain  1 to  10  of nuclei stained     Rare tumor cells stain    1  of nuclei stain